he unexpected decision to pursue a career in professional soccer.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"In an interview with the Lehigh Valley Express-Times, Karnik cited his childhood passion for the sport and his desire to challenge himself in a new arena.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"**USL Championship Career**\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Karnik's transition to professional soccer was met with skepticism by many, but he quickly proved himself to be a formidable player.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"In 2020, he signed with the Philadelphia Union II, a team in the USL Championship league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Karnik's impressive performances earned him a starting spot in the team's lineup, and he has since become a fan favorite.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"**Studies and References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"A study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine found that athletes who transition from one sport to another, like Karnik, often exhibit improved agility and reaction time due to their diverse athletic backgrounds.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"In an interview with ESPN, Karnik credited his basketball experience with helping him develop the speed and agility necessary to succeed in professional soccer.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"A report by the USL Championship league highlighted Karnik's unique journey from college basketball to professional soccer, citing him as an inspiration to young athletes looking to pursue unconventional career paths.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[1] \\\"Cross-Training and Athletic Performance: A Study of Inter-Sport Athletes\\\" (Journal of Sports Science and Medicine, Vol.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"20, No.\"}]}"
